{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6e/jsm2tmkr8t9gxkwt8x31kdciojhz6lk.mp3","text":"啊，好闲，我想去逛街......不管了，我要出门！......嗯？你怎么还不换鞋？你当然要跟我走啊，不然呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_001.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/04/iqw5hi40cf20e3sma3ax2yltxsoojfd.mp3","text":"啊，好闲，我想去逛街......不管了，我要出门！......嗯？你怎么还不换鞋？你当然要跟我走啊，不然呢。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/80/77y5qzzseo75k4qhiw8xj96dxcplvn4.mp3","text":"看你一副很无聊的样子......喏，这个玩具给你。在工作？工作不就是很无聊吗？你可要看紧了，这个小偶人，一不注意就会消失掉哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/dug0f2etfb967zmdhpca5tbx48i64x4.mp3","text":"哎，好饿啊，自己做个菜比我打个锅还难......我有个弟弟很擅长这事儿，每次聚会的时候，你想吃什么他就做什么，那才叫厨师！罗德岛食堂做的是个锤子菜啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/gywxeww1cpdnnw0vjny260slqeifkbp.mp3","text":"龙门是个不错的地方，但口味太淡了，一点都不辣，这怎么行！我和你说，辣，是种生活态度，当些微的刺痛感和浓烈的冲动在舌头上面爆开的时候，你会觉得，“啊，我的人生真有滋味。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_004.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/52/ipdcwidj2gqzcp0loxufc20vnx7nh71.mp3","text":"看你一副很无聊的样子......喏，这个玩具给你。在工作？工作不就是很无聊吗？你可要看紧了，这个小偶人，一不注意就会消失掉哦。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/34/jxn61l2xiq96aa2t50w4y32q04vflqb.mp3","text":"哎，好饿啊，自己做个菜比我打个锅还难......我有个弟弟很擅长这事儿，每次聚会的时候，你想吃什么他就做什么，那才叫厨师！罗德岛食堂做的是个锤子菜啊。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/75/3njs5bsnt0kgfhzf5pmydea5o8gpjtd.mp3","text":"龙门是个不错的地方，但口味太淡了，一点都不辣，这怎么行！我和你说，辣，是种生活态度，当些微的刺痛感和浓烈的冲动在舌头上面爆开的时候，你会觉得，“啊，我的人生真有滋味。”","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/52/0zeb24wep31z6wyo93bh690fjdpiupx.mp3","text":"我擅长的，原先只是种非常生活化的技术，只是我实在太容易被现状影响了，现在的我可真是战火缠身哪。熟悉了一把把武器拿在手里的感觉，偶尔手头空空还会有那么点不适应，真难办。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/76/cfnuxaxyjcq94xxdpvmckl48pqam2qr.mp3","text":"仪式之所以能不断流传，不在于它本身有什么意义，而在于它为众人带来了什么意义。演出有收获，企盼有回报，这又是我喜欢的故事类型，何乐不为呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_006.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/31/pdgj63ef9461mznmsw0anom7gyeabsy.mp3","text":"我擅长的，原先只是种非常生活化的技术，只是我实在太容易被现状影响了，现在的我可真是战火缠身哪。熟悉了一把把武器拿在手里的感觉，偶尔手头空空还会有那么点不适应，真难办。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/mf3wy7aryh0sx3r7vpufnbviuqfe6yi.mp3","text":"仪式之所以能不断流传，不在于它本身有什么意义，而在于它为众人带来了什么意义。演出有收获，企盼有回报，这又是我喜欢的故事类型，何乐不为呢？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:1/15/ox8snzoy7tnfvllr8afy1xkpr81cvqx.mp3","text":"不适应现实的人会被现实淘汰，这算是很普通的常识吧？但我的兄弟姐妹里，还是有那么几个一直不肯放下架子呢。活的那么无趣，岁月会变成一种折磨啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/db/htib7sp2xex23pkp99vbhwp6z54dr8o.mp3","text":"这么多年过来，我的梦已经变得很模糊了。唉，比起做梦，还有更重要的事情等着我去做，也许这就是活着。活着真难啊，可别人努力活下去的样子，我真是喜欢得不得了。你，要不要试试做我的砧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/29/ph52x17uou3u6z9rr30kv5y2pcelk6g.mp3","text":"冶铸是种凡俗工艺，但它也曾是往日生活的某种起源。纵使其它的一切都磨灭了，我也会把它保存得好好的，这是我曾经的选择。你也作出过重要的选择吧？看到最后吧。看到最后，才算完满。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_009.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/a83p8oeo2z8998inbg59iy737l111wp.mp3","text":"不适应现实的人会被现实淘汰，这算是很普通的常识吧？但我的兄弟姐妹里，还是有那么几个一直不肯放下架子呢。活的那么无趣，岁月会变成一种折磨啊。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/37/ahghhd990f6o5qflpyuub841eyq37w8.mp3","text":"这么多年过来，我的梦已经变得很模糊了。唉，比起做梦，还有更重要的事情等着我去做，也许这就是活着。活着真难啊，可别人努力活下去的样子，我真是喜欢得不得了。你，要不要试试做我的砧？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/9rsblzvgya1uc7lbo3ng5xjv4wzyt0v.mp3","text":"冶铸是种凡俗工艺，但它也曾是往日生活的某种起源。纵使其它的一切都磨灭了，我也会把它保存得好好的，这是我曾经的选择。你也作出过重要的选择吧？看到最后吧。看到最后，才算完满。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/aco4p882vuvsttc3tikt00pbudzwfyk.mp3","text":"你怎么又睡着了？起来起来，陪我去买点东西，快点快点。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_010.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/55/8xu89rycmezql43i7fvoaldy4zt9inf.mp3","text":"你怎么又睡着了？起来起来，陪我去买点东西，快点快点。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:8/83/iwha2vpbnwrupaphie2if9kac41jpgy.mp3","text":"有人吗？贵公司的员工和我说这里生活条件很好，免费食宿，还有多种多样的娱乐方式......闲杂人员不得入内？哎，别这样，给个面子嘛。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_011.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/11/ggm1s8mn7q380buiu1vwgdphltgr2pp.mp3","text":"有人吗？贵公司的员工和我说这里生活条件很好，免费食宿，还有多种多样的娱乐方式......闲杂人员不得入内？哎，别这样，给个面子嘛。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:0/01/9fca1jv95jpqyw9fdd75mbkc8kxhymb.mp3","text":"嗯？这些东西对我毫无帮助啊。技巧什么的，只对看重它的人有用吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_012.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/46/d06hi3bcwx1et2efn5y8pe2u1tvq975.mp3","text":"嗯？这些东西对我毫无帮助啊。技巧什么的，只对看重它的人有用吧。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/mgovdnovndb4lwn94ed8auvr4inyahx.mp3","text":"晋升？我想想......是哦，过去好像也有这种事情来着。挺好的，谢谢你！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_013.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/55zvnlpjflomuzwgb90gttz4xy7gze1.mp3","text":"晋升？我想想......是哦，过去好像也有这种事情来着。挺好的，谢谢你！","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/8s8xzg1y6yh88q10a0ribe23vct4ppk.mp3","text":"人和器物一样，有着品格之分。你还算有点意思，或者说......你本就不太一样？你似乎值得我铸把兵器。哎，可你又打不了架，铸剑送你，很浪费啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_014.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/34/4f0iir3e7bl3f1y4arnjpnvz7c59ass.mp3","text":"人和器物一样，有着品格之分。你还算有点意思，或者说......你本就不太一样？你似乎值得我铸把兵器。哎，可你又打不了架，铸剑送你，很浪费啊。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/goosa84s0oadm6ghx8a5tok0dp8qnlo.mp3","text":"干戈之事，真是在哪个时代都避不过啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_017.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/truf2rut0ufwqvii7c21mhdjopnba03.mp3","text":"干戈之事，真是在哪个时代都避不过啊。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/buhdrg8ois2vsbypmffpp2n4rf1gi4o.mp3","text":"啊？指挥？我没做过欸，行不行啊我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_018.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/54/ccy2c9qla6c8gjtf4osp2mcfwhrdc2c.mp3","text":"啊？指挥？我没做过欸，行不行啊我。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:0/02/cqdfggltrcm5sqjhgn2y4pzvopxrzzg.mp3","text":"打造武器的工匠，必须承担它们带来的血腥。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_019.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/4q2r48jrgoxib1y1gu9o61gdopxdwaq.mp3","text":"打造武器的工匠，必须承担它们带来的血腥。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/25boc1kpzye185zphc149fmjexcquyu.mp3","text":"这把剑能把你们的存在价值连同肉体一起划开。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_020.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/af/0r7kmc12hhctdr60kvmw31kdw8z1h43.mp3","text":"这把剑能把你们的存在价值连同肉体一起划开。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/ebcea3g5ql8q0ymx5s81qnqgtnrvg44.mp3","text":"哦？要我亲自动手吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/62/dhdmks7p0i8lwnmzshxisblxqkc720s.mp3","text":"铸乃众相之柱。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_022.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/lxjupe58puv25jzmwf7k03z6ujf653n.mp3","text":"哦？要我亲自动手吗？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/65/63a3s0pi93bln4lz0a7dsqsfo3ooary.mp3","text":"铸乃众相之柱。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/ttljbxuw9p6tl05osh4h91k0x628ffb.mp3","text":"“生杀之机，焉能拱手相让？”","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/obytpdtwy10eqog18311jrc2gobgay2.mp3","text":"哎，赶紧解决了事啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_024.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/99ehkk4lnvmdlgh6y9tcmy8cx55lt5u.mp3","text":"“生杀之机，焉能拱手相让？”","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/68/kuggjgx9j2gzyyc1bo9g26t4w201ii7.mp3","text":"哎，赶紧解决了事啦。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/hleic5ev5tcjr78qqtd3vrghnwnc0uq.mp3","text":"以子之矛攻子之盾，就会产生大爆炸！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/t3wbw9qv9413zh88754qfz1oo0jfsn7.mp3","text":"我的身体内部，可是一千四百度喔。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7e/6ouudcnd51ifvg693picq14o9556cbx.mp3","text":"“明王圣帝，谁能去兵哉？”","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/cm77kln1038id6h2g4ki48r2pmg77fh.mp3","text":"我为什么要在你们这些低劣造物上浪费时间？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_028.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/qmenfv9ig175ist7gae4ij9neqc33dg.mp3","text":"以子之矛攻子之盾，就会产生大爆炸！","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/ha95dzpoyujrlugm8yi4jwx64yt6maq.mp3","text":"我的身体内部，可是一千四百度喔。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/42/71knkrcdpgm3x20ue9giythduhawmrl.mp3","text":"“明王圣帝，谁能去兵哉？”","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/0qiueir2t8c12q10mbqbql12z1aacsq.mp3","text":"我为什么要在你们这些低劣造物上浪费时间？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/rltuzlwpjx7i1isakre00wv36e2m6ub.mp3","text":"不错嘛！在你身上，我看到了你们的一线希望哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_029.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/25/9rqnoxta5jy8cfbld7jt8vlljxjh6aj.mp3","text":"不错嘛！在你身上，我看到了你们的一线希望哦。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/0h125gcub5ym1cbvrj8ymr5mhi39xxl.mp3","text":"这点小菜还不够填牙缝的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_030.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/oj4a4pz0amgf5x3atzu9w6hxardys3j.mp3","text":"这点小菜还不够填牙缝的。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/3g0sy2dnotay931ldkjzxuxmy6kjtkt.mp3","text":"喂，怎么出差错了？铸件里可不能有气孔呀。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_031.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/ifjdce11esouwgee3uchnj12pjzqqij.mp3","text":"喂，怎么出差错了？铸件里可不能有气孔呀。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:2/24/go08nm09gwhpnaef47jox85x9p58s6l.mp3","text":"行不行啊......让我出力的话，各位队员将会遇到的危险，也许比现在还大。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_032.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/72/oqbeiqsqoedrmbe9mhahd7epa1a411x.mp3","text":"行不行啊......让我出力的话，各位队员将会遇到的危险，也许比现在还大。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6e/iuxgp3nwozi7b1mb08yk1pys99kd3ha.mp3","text":"我能不能自己装饰寝室？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_033.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/lpajrcpdch4vzrvm7xgdn802zpyx1tu.mp3","text":"我能不能自己装饰寝室？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/3fviuxsw5h43ybn3wyn6ki1iybsfhmt.mp3","text":"欸，不要啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_034.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/6m3m8njdmkegl80k4rsmr4rk1rgvf0p.mp3","text":"欸，不要啦。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:3/35/51kw23rk28yv6k8p3icqffs8qbtshyg.mp3","text":"别动！在给你做挂饰呢，稳重点！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_036.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/57/ilo0v082pid5yea9ytts1d6ysihipsq.mp3","text":"别动！在给你做挂饰呢，稳重点！","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3b/co3ah7tcsmjzb2i2tytiakpxxjyj7nn.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_037.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/0dbw96cm3wx12axekgs9ev5wya4jq2p.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:d/df/nlm0vqyqmlpi5vm2u7thfb6ihonbgiq.mp3","text":"来了来了来了！可算到了这一天，该推出我的全新巨制了！对，就是之前那个《无极玄战·巨怪末日围攻》，那可是我呕心沥血搞出来的特效大片。你不看？今天不是大家都放假吗，干嘛不来？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_038.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e3/3ll0h3nuv9exxtyr8wxypcq8tctne69.mp3","text":"来了来了来了！可算到了这一天，该推出我的全新巨制了！对，就是之前那个《无极玄战·巨怪末日围攻》，那可是我呕心沥血搞出来的特效大片。你不看？今天不是大家都放假吗，干嘛不来？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/ewqncewqq5j1gkjus33nxicsxu2tjao.mp3","text":"博士，你吃了没？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2014_nian/cn_042.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/hxzrcgu8w8bodtb23wib87gsn9mcs9v.mp3","text":"博士，你吃了没？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2014_nian_cn_topolect/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/nb44ja0g8iqh2jin75snbrtnv0y0jpb.mp3","text":"啊，好闲，我想去逛街......不管了，我要出门！......嗯？你怎么还不换鞋？你当然要跟我走啊，不然呢。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/9xd7karmhe01reh03ca2i92e4g5grn9.mp3","text":"看你一副很无聊的样子......喏，这个玩具给你。在工作？工作不就是很无聊吗？你可要看紧了，这个小偶人，一不注意就会消失掉哦。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/86/3kxsvu196aiv11iwh8bu3772rgg3gwz.mp3","text":"哎，好饿啊，自己做个菜比我打个锅还难......我有个弟弟很擅长这事儿，每次聚会的时候，你想吃什么他就做什么，那才叫厨师！罗德岛食堂做的是个锤子菜啊。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7d/kqrbz3jieqwvdhclyuy9g8qz8y98ns4.mp3","text":"龙门是个不错的地方，但口味太淡了，一点都不辣，这怎么行！我和你说，辣，是种生活态度，当些微的刺痛感和浓烈的冲动在舌头上面爆开的时候，你会觉得，“啊，我的人生真有滋味。”","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/s075xcpbywhuqsn16fe6ebihzva4q6c.mp3","text":"我擅长的，原先只是种非常生活化的技术，只是我实在太容易被现状影响了，现在的我可真是战火缠身哪。熟悉了一把把武器拿在手里的感觉，偶尔手头空空还会有那么点不适应，真难办。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/47/3oxq6eph4qft1dtoq39x5sg70kulk6g.mp3","text":"仪式之所以能不断流传，不在于它本身有什么意义，而在于它为众人带来了什么意义。演出有收获，企盼有回报，这又是我喜欢的故事类型，何乐不为呢？","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:8/82/bbwlcxtbm1wfgss4t7rn8nqbd7n6mlu.mp3","text":"不适应现实的人会被现实淘汰，这算是很普通的常识吧？但我的兄弟姐妹里，还是有那么几个一直不肯放下架子呢。活的那么无趣，岁月会变成一种折磨啊。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/27/71j0yc57l7mskllsk8kogp8g48vx9af.mp3","text":"这么多年过来，我的梦已经变得很模糊了。唉，比起做梦，还有更重要的事情等着我去做，也许这就是活着。活着真难啊，可别人努力活下去的样子，我真是喜欢得不得了。你，要不要试试做我的砧？","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/25/fsx319n75k2rz3n7m0maq1x9ja8taks.mp3","text":"冶铸是种凡俗工艺，但它也曾是往日生活的某种起源。纵使其它的一切都磨灭了，我也会把它保存得好好的，这是我曾经的选择。你也作出过重要的选择吧？看到最后吧。看到最后，才算完满。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:3/32/b4a2oosif0r45b64kly8hsr9qke7exx.mp3","text":"你怎么又睡着了？起来起来，陪我去买点东西，快点快点。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/d6kdnaxwygxzbxc1rdyx35arvdj2mbu.mp3","text":"有人吗？贵公司的员工和我说这里生活条件很好，免费食宿，还有多种多样的娱乐方式......闲杂人员不得入内？哎，别这样，给个面子嘛。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/52/789r0aercct0fzvbzxc4yufa34ixt4c.mp3","text":"嗯？这些东西对我毫无帮助啊。技巧什么的，只对看重它的人有用吧。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/71rgad9kwuaa6c4t8n0g0fryfwc83pb.mp3","text":"晋升？我想想......是哦，过去好像也有这种事情来着。挺好的，谢谢你！","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/o6r5qjboq5kjhe9tmismb5vnlawn5oy.mp3","text":"人和器物一样，有着品格之分。你还算有点意思，或者说......你本就不太一样？你似乎值得我铸把兵器。哎，可你又打不了架，铸剑送你，很浪费啊。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:5/50/2mujwha6mp5mz3vs05imzj83vpmelu7.mp3","text":"干戈之事，真是在哪个时代都避不过啊。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:7/70/hf4mo6qolznmuajablkp7smboswm1y4.mp3","text":"啊？指挥？我没做过欸，行不行啊我。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/0cul8vpkc6w0l6a2mpjqxldzqqtaklj.mp3","text":"打造武器的工匠，必须承担它们带来的血腥。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/bo98pi9iri58aaeaovm9wnsd9cm8937.mp3","text":"这把剑能把你们的存在价值连同肉体一起划开。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:0/01/rf6z0z6kspli65f4ey6aurwvlg9h68s.mp3","text":"哦？要我亲自动手吗？","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/ey379sow9ye2t0gh0tamtjoio0qm9o7.mp3","text":"铸乃众相之柱。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:4/49/aook1t5hp21r81s3wvijjw4zlmmyhtc.mp3","text":"“生杀之机，焉能拱手相让？”","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/df/7vrjtemdgrz99ek9yznnqw12nsid117.mp3","text":"哎，赶紧解决了事啦。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/gx1dgphvddf2mgj491kdopci9susf9r.mp3","text":"以子之矛攻子之盾，就会产生大爆炸！","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/45/3p8f4jgm5i4iu0igqtcidfaqjl5askw.mp3","text":"我的身体内部，可是一千四百度喔。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/30/8ljawyk6ioegwwsf9f37hfffb0cnwzs.mp3","text":"“明王圣帝，谁能去兵哉？”","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/04/a32r9l4dmz29honxmmqrgrle5gdvyip.mp3","text":"我为什么要在你们这些低劣造物上浪费时间？","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/1vlex2k74wn3nazn0tbdbj0g0utpdur.mp3","text":"不错嘛！在你身上，我看到了你们的一线希望哦。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5d/nh2lnq22b3zpct3pegaalknxt64xomq.mp3","text":"这点小菜还不够填牙缝的。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/krerjooehk7c4z8cwcyvy1ixhnxu30u.mp3","text":"喂，怎么出差错了？铸件里可不能有气孔呀。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:8/84/8vsmj7vluwluziydmw0gbz4jo8tv7ro.mp3","text":"行不行啊......让我出力的话，各位队员将会遇到的危险，也许比现在还大。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:6/61/khwxqx4ubjtelif7ylrssxw182pqcht.mp3","text":"我能不能自己装饰寝室？","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/a8ah82onqi767w07byb34y0dbgogx32.mp3","text":"欸，不要啦。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:6/64/sjtgi6opfl2w6g9404gi4os1cjxau8i.mp3","text":"别动！在给你做挂饰呢，稳重点！","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9c/mfiejjx6s2wr77ic3lj3apagdlofawq.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/e8yl1x3b235tzhkrdjmigi7mzlxfdam.mp3","text":"来了来了来了！可算到了这一天，该推出我的全新巨制了！对，就是之前那个《无极玄战·巨怪末日围攻》，那可是我呕心沥血搞出来的特效大片。你不看？今天不是大家都放假吗，干嘛不来？","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:2/24/9ybvzyfj06wr8n37nqzz0iavexcdb8t.mp3","text":"博士，你吃了没？","alt":"voice/char_2014_nian/cn_042.mp3"}]}}